=ADch l=C5=A9y t=E1=BB=AB k=E1=BB=B3 coupon g=E1=BA=A7n nh=E1=BA=A5t =C4=91=
=E1=BA=BFn ng=C3=A0y thanh to=C3=A1n mua<br>
       1. N=E1=BA=BFu Ng=C3=A0y mua &lt;=3D Ng=C3=A0y ch=E1=BB=91t danh s=
=C3=A1ch c=E1=BB=A7a k=E1=BB=B3 coupon t=C6=B0=C6=A1ng =E1=BB=A9ng: Gi=C3=
=A1 mua =3D&nbsp; M=E1=BB=87nh gi=C3=A1 + l=C3=A3i c=E1=BB=99ng d=E1=BB=93n=
<br>
       &nbsp;2.N=E1=BA=BFu Ng=C3=A0y mua &gt; Ng=C3=A0y ch=E1=BB=91t danh s=
=C3=A1ch c=E1=BB=A7a k=E1=BB=B3 coupon t=C6=B0=C6=A1ng =E1=BB=A9ng:&nbsp; G=
i=C3=A1 mua =3D M=E1=BB=87nh gi=C3=A1</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>C=C3=B4ng th=E1=BB=A9c: PricePerBond =3D ROUND(FaceValue + FaceValu=
e * CouponRate * (BuySettleDate - LastCouponDate) / 365, 0)<br>
       Di=E1=BB=85n gi=E1=BA=A3i: M=E1=BB=87nh gi=C3=A1 + ti=E1=BB=81n l=C3=
=A3i t=C3=ADch l=C5=A9y =C4=91=E1=BA=BFn ng=C3=A0y mua</p></td>
